  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection of street children in Ouaga 2013-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skydd f&#xf6;r gatubarn i Ouagadougou 2013-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d under 2013-2014 till burkinsk NGO SamuSocial som genomf&#xf6;r skydd  verksamhet (psykosocial st&#xf6;d, v&#xe5;rd, rehabilitering) f&#xf6;r ungef&#xe4;r 1000  heml&#xf6;sa pojkar som bor p&#xe5; gatan i Ouagadougou. Samfinansieing (45%)   med Monacos regering, samt andra givare (Unicef, fransk               utvecklingssamarbete myndighet (ADF)),och prival sektorn (Total,      Sanofi).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support during 2013-2014 to the Burkinab&#xe8; NGO SamuSocial which        conducts night patrolls in Ouagadougou for protecting around 1000     street children, including psychosocial support, health care and      rehabilitation. Co-funding (45%) with the principate of Monaco and    other donors (Unicef, French Development Cooperation Agency),         including the private sector (Total, Sanofi).</narrative>
  </description>
